      "feedback": "自动测试：20/21。\n用例 ring-end-4，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 average, error, status, windowSizeReached。\nLTL 检查：not_run。",
      "idx": 1,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK FB_MovingAverage\nVAR_INPUT\n    cyclicExecution : BOOL;\n    trigger : BOOL;\n    value : LREAL;\n    windowSize : INT;\n    reset : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    average : LREAL;\n    windowSizeReached : BOOL;\n    error : BOOL;\n    status : WORD;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    buffer : ARRAY[1..100] OF LREAL;\n    count : INT := 0;\n    sum : LREAL := 0.0;\n    lastTrigger : BOOL := FALSE;\n    triggerEdge : BOOL;\n    i : INT;\nEND_VAR\n\n// Rising edge detection for external trigger\ntriggerEdge := trigger AND NOT lastTrigger;\nlastTrigger := trigger;\n\n// Validate window size\nIF (windowSize < 1) OR (windowSize > 100) THEN\n    error := TRUE;\n    status := 16#8200;\n    average := 0.0;\n    windowSizeReached := FALSE;\n    count := 0;\n    sum := 0.0;\n    FOR i := 1 TO 100 DO\n        buffer[i] := 0.0;\n    END_FOR;\nELSE\n    error := FALSE;\n    status := 16#0000;\n\n    IF reset THEN\n        // Reset all internal state\n        count := 0;\n        sum := 0.0;\n        FOR i := 1 TO 100 DO\n            buffer[i] := 0.0;\n        END_FOR;\n    ELSIF cyclicExecution OR triggerEdge THEN\n        // New value should be added\n        IF count < windowSize THEN\n            // Still filling the window\n            count := count + 1;\n            buffer[count] := value;\n            sum := sum + value;\n        ELSE\n            // Window full: remove oldest, add newest\n            sum := sum - buffer[1] + value;\n            // Shift buffer left\n            IF windowSize > 1 THEN\n                FOR i := 1 TO windowSize - 1 DO\n                    buffer[i] := buffer[i + 1];\n                END_FOR;\n            END_IF;\n            buffer[windowSize] := value;\n        END_IF;\n    END_IF;\n\n    IF count > 0 THEN\n        average := sum / INT_TO_LREAL(count);\n    ELSE\n        average := 0.0;\n    END_IF;\n    windowSizeReached := (count >= windowSize);\nEND_IF;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
